work with a simpler story or a more sort of&nbsp;
straightforward mainstream kind of story with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:56.960
one main character who's sort of pursuing one&nbsp;
main goal in the story that'll be easier just to&nbsp;&nbsp;

